<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Trimmed kernel_platform (kleaf/Bazel) manifest for the RedMagic 9 Pro
  (Qualcomm "pineapple" / SM8650, android14-6.1) kernel tree.

  Derived from CodeLinaro release:
    AU_LINUX_KERNEL.PLATFORM.3.0.C1.00.00.00.057.010
    (clo/la/kernelplatform/manifest)

  This is the EARLIEST CLO pineapple android14-6.1 drop. Its pinned clang
  prebuilt (clang-r487747c) matches this tree's common/build.config.constants
  exactly, so it is the correct toolchain drop for this source.

  The two source projects that this repository ALREADY provides are removed
  from the manifest so `repo sync` only fetches the missing kleaf tooling and
  prebuilts, leaving our own sources authoritative:
      * kernel/common   -> kernel_platform/common       (provided by this repo)
      * kernel/qcom     -> kernel_platform/msm-kernel    (provided by this repo)
  (kernel_platform/qcom proprietary is not part of this manifest at all.)

  Because those two projects are removed, the three <linkfile> entries they
  normally create are recreated by the workflow after sync:
      kernel_platform/WORKSPACE              -> msm-kernel/bazel.WORKSPACE
      kernel_platform/build_with_bazel.py    -> msm-kernel/build_with_bazel.py
      kernel_platform/.source_date_epoch_dir -> common
-->
